<title>CANADA: Brascan seeks approval for class B shares.</title>
<headline>Brascan seeks approval for class B shares.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brascan Ltd said on Monday that it would seek shareholder approval for a new class of shares that would track certain business units of the company.</p>
<p>&quot;While the corporation currently has no specific plans for the issue of class B shares, consideration is being given to issuing such shares targeted to the corporation's Brazilian operations or one specific operating division thereof,&quot; Brascan said in a statement.</p>
<p>The vote on the special resolution will occur at Brascan's annual meeting on April 30.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
